        "rotate_image": 0,
        "image_position": "left",
        "image_size": "half",
        "disable_media_style": true,
        "enable_logo": false,
        "title": "",
        "heading_size": "heading-standard",
        "richtext": "<p>From the very beginning, our family and this business have been inseparable. Forty years ago, as we were starting our Family, we were also nurturing a vision for a business built on creativity, craftsmanship, and connection. What started as a passion for design has grown into a legacy of innovation, dedication, and local support. Through hard work, perseverance, and the strength of our partnerships, we’ve built something that goes beyond business—it’s family. As the next generation Takes over, we’re honored to see our legacy continue, evolving with the times while staying true to the values that brought us here.</p><h3>Jim & Sharon Kelly</h3><p>Leadership Team & Founders of Designer T’s</p>",
        "text_alignment": "text-left",
        "button_link": "",
        "button_label": "Shop Now",
        "button_link1": "",
        "button_label1": "Shop Now",
        "color_scheme": "tertiary",
        "use_gradient_background": false
      }
    },
    "testimonials_3DAC9G": {
      "type": "testimonials",
      "blocks": {
        "testimonial_7NwQ8b": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/tim5.jpg",
            "rating": "none",
            "quote": "<p>From the very beginning, our family and this business have been inseparable. Forty years ago, as we were welcoming our son into the world—who now a proud leader at this company—we were also nurturing a vision for a business built on creativity, craftsmanship, and connection. What started as a passion for design has grown into a legacy of innovation, dedication, and local support. Through hard work, perseverance, and the strength of our partnerships, we’ve built something that goes beyond business—it’s family. We’re honored to see our legacy continue, evolving with the times while staying true to the values that brought us here.</p>",
            "source": "Jim & Sharon Kelly",
            "source1": "Leadership Team & Founders of Designer T’s"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "testimonial_7NwQ8b"
