    "image_with_text_QCxHTJ": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "disabled": true,
      "settings": {
        "display_on_card": true,
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/Images.png",
        "crop": "",
        "image_shape": "default",
        "blob_type": 1,
        "rotate_image": 0,
        "image_position": "left",
        "image_size": "third",
        "disable_media_style": false,
        "enable_logo": false,
        "title": "",
        "heading_size": "heading-feature",
        "richtext": "<p>As a graphic artist, I’ve always believed in the power of design to tell a story and connect people. Forty years ago, as I was giving birth to my son who now leads this company I was reviewing artwork. This brand has been woven into our family’s journey from the start. With the support of my husband and family, I worked to break barriers as a woman in a male-dominated field, building a company rooted in creativity and meaningful impact. I’m proud of how far we’ve come and excited to see our legacy continue providing quality, local support while expanding our reach and innovation.\"</p>",
        "text_alignment": "text-left",
        "button_link": "",
        "button_label": "Shop Now",
        "button_link1": "",
        "button_label1": "Shop Now",
        "color_scheme": "primary",
        "use_gradient_background": false
      }
    },
    "our_process_qmjJrg": {
      "type": "our-process",
      "blocks": {
        "column_PCyETg": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "show_image": true,
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/DSC_8134.jpg",
            "enable_logo": false,
            "title": "",
            "text": "<p>Provide your artwork and order details along with your specific requirements. Whether you have a company logo, a custom illustration, or a completely unique concept in mind, our team is ready to transform your ideas into high-quality custom apparel. No matter the complexity of your design, we ensure a seamless process to bring your vision to life with precision and creativity.</p>",
            "cta_link": "",
            "cta_text": "",
            "color_scheme": "same_as_section"
          }
        },
        "column_CFF8nf": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "show_image": true,
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/IMG_5351.heic",
            "enable_logo": false,
            "title": "",
            "text": "<p>Our skilled team meticulously reviews and enhances your design, ensuring it aligns perfectly with your vision. We work closely with you throughout the process, refining every detail, including color accuracy, design placement, fabric selection, and overall fit. Whether you need adjustments to improve clarity, sizing, or aesthetics, we can provide you with expert guidance and support.</p>",
            "cta_link": "",
            "cta_text": "",
            "color_scheme": "same_as_section"
          }
        },
        "column_7tg883": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "show_image": true,
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/DSC_8065.jpg",
            "enable_logo": false,
            "title": "",
            "text": "<p>Once your design is finalized, our team brings it to life with expert craftsmanship and precision. Using high-quality materials and advanced techniques, we ensure perfect color accuracy, stitching, and overall quality. After a thorough quality check, we carefully package and deliver your custom apparel on time, exactly as you envisioned. Your satisfaction is our top priority.</p>",
            "cta_link": "",
            "cta_text": "",
            "color_scheme": "same_as_section"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "column_PCyETg",
        "column_CFF8nf",
        "column_7tg883"
      ],
