      "blocks": {
        "testimonial_pk694C": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "rating": "5_stars",
            "quote": "<p>This company is awesome, I have worked with a lot of different companies for shirts and different marketing apparel, and I have to say these guys are head and shoulders above everyone else. They made the process very easy, and made the perfect recommendation of shirt to use. On top of everything else they were the best priced!!!! Tim and his team will be getting all my business going forward. Keep up the great work guys!</p>",
            "source": "Adam Huesser",
            "source1": ""
          }
        },
        "testimonial_MPGxpB": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "rating": "5_stars",
            "quote": "<p>What a wonderful experience from start to finish! I love Designer T's early start @ 7 am. They were always quick to answer the phone + my emails. My daughter's uniforms for school turned out perfect 🤌 In fact, I think their uniforms are better than the uniforms presented for purchase by the school !! Thank you Designer T's, we will be back again.</p>",
            "source": "Jessie Jordan",
            "source1": ""
          }
        },
        "testimonial_pGQDAL": {
